      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::000::abstract::c334ecd44f"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Short-duration annealing refines the interlamellar spacing of the FCC/B2 microstructure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Short-duration annealing enhances the coherence or bonding of the interfaces between FCC and B2 lamellae.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brief annealing produces limited atomic diffusion in the eutectic HEA.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limited atomic diffusion caused by the anneal refines the lamellar spacing.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Limited atomic diffusion caused by the anneal reinforces bonding at the phase interfaces.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refined lamellar spacing increases dislocation blocking and therefore increases strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enhanced phase-interface coherence permits more uniform plastic flow and therefore improves ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed microstructural changes mitigate the strength–ductility trade-off.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
